## Book Metadata

- **Title:** Can't We Just Print More Money? Economics in Ten Simple Questions
- **Authors:** Rupal Patel and Jack Meaning (economists at the Bank of England)
- **Publisher:** Cornerstone Press (Penguin)
- **Structure:** 10 chapters + Introduction + Conclusion + Appendix
  ("Economics in 51 Even Simpler Questions")

